---

The questionnaire items in data/items.json are in the public domain, sourced from the
International Personality Item Pool (https://ipip.ori.org/).

Norm data under data/ is derived from Johnson's IPIP-NEO data repository
(https://osf.io/tbmh5/). Please cite:

  Johnson, J. A. (2014). Measuring thirty facets of the Five Factor Model with a
  120-item public domain inventory: Development of the IPIP-NEO-120.
  Journal of Research in Personality, 51, 78-89.
